C_{\mathrm{fx}}(S, S_{\mathrm{max}}, K) = \operatorname{P}_{\mathrm{fl}}(S, \max (S_{\mathrm{max}}, K)) + S e^{-qT} - K e^{-rT} \\
\operatorname{P}_{\mathrm{fx}}(S, S_{\mathrm{min}}, K) = C_{\mathrm{fl}}(S, \min (S_{\mathrm{min}}, K)) - S e^{-qT} + K e^{-rT}
